      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You tap into ancient powers and the oldest tales of avekiri who once soared into the stars itself in their search for Rahm or to reach the planes beyond. When you Fly, you gain the Cosmic trait, allowing you to Fly and breathe while in space or in a vacuum or zero gravity environment. In addition, you gain a +10 status bonus to your Fly speed and an astral haze coats you as you do, granting you a +2 circumstance bonus to Maneuver in Flight.</span></p>"
